{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>A day of teru'ah.</b> It is a commandment to sound the teru'ah, for if this statement referred to the day's burnt offering, why did he not mention it for the other festivals? Furthermore, for all the burnt offerings he commanded to sound the teki'ah, not the teru'ah."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 29, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:19:45.367698312Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}